                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an obscene manner; vulgarly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "842cd772-917d-376d-be3f-fb8d242f7f0c",
                                        "entry_id": "58e0ddaa-c0b8-398a-839f-ac8c4de05436",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an excessive manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07210243-5fdb-4149-8ada-5467a8d16a11",
                                                "sense_id": "842cd772-917d-376d-be3f-fb8d242f7f0c",
                                                "text": "I live in an elderly building in Boston's Back Bay. In summer the place sizzles. In winter, it's hotter (unless, of course, the wind blows. Then there's no heat at all. I suspect our central heating unit is an obscenely large candle that gets blown out when we need it most.)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e26cf7f-49a6-4cdb-b2d5-17b6788f65c0",
                                                "sense_id": "842cd772-917d-376d-be3f-fb8d242f7f0c",
                                                "text": "By the year 1765, Richard `Dickie' Tattersall, the absurdly romantic self-styled soldier of fortune and indulged son of an obscenely well-off Yorkshire squire, was brimming with gratitude[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
